# This repository lives at the workspace root. It tracks:
#   - README.md            -- workspace overview (moved up from dev-containers/)
#   - LICENSE / NOTICE      -- Apache 2.0 license and notice
#   - readme/              -- README image assets (headline, contributors)
#   - .github/             -- GitHub Actions (e.g. the submodule-bump workflow)
#   - .claude/skills       -- the shared Claude Code skills
#   - dev-containers       -- the per-story DevContainer tooling (flat files)
#   - .gitmodules + the referenced repos below, as git submodules
# The workspace also holds sibling directories that must stay untracked:
# legacy repos (blueprint-workflowmodule-*, vanillabp-camunda*) and plain,
# non-repo scratch dirs (prompts*, dev-containers-blueprints, processengineapi-adapter).
#
# gitignore rule that makes this work: a re-include (!) only takes effect if the
# file's PARENT directory is not excluded -- hence we re-include the parent dirs
# first, then narrow inside them.

# Ignore every top-level entry...
/*

# ...but keep these files and directories.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE
!/readme/
!/dev-containers/
!/.claude/

# Within .claude, keep only skills (drop settings.local.json and anything else).
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/

# Referenced repos, tracked as git submodules (cloned via --recurse-submodules).
# Legacy (blueprint-workflowmodule-*, vanillabp-camunda*) is intentionally absent.
!/adapter-platform-integration/
!/adapter-platform-integration.wiki/
!/blueprints/
!/blueprints-organisation-page/
!/camunda7-adapter/
!/camunda7-adapter.wiki/
!/camunda8-adapter/
!/camunda8-adapter.wiki/
!/process-engine-api-adapter/
!/process-engine-api-adapter.wiki/
!/renovate-config/
!/spi-for-java/
